323 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 223 0 R
/E (Project Management System is a new, standalone product and is not a follow on to an existing system. It consists of a React based frontend, a Django REST Framework backend, a PostgreSQL database, and a WebSocket layer built using Django Channels for pushing live updates to connected clients. The frontend communicates with the backend using a REST API for standard operations and a WebSocket connection for real time task and activity updates. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
