>>
endobj
822 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 234 0 R
/E (This document specifies the software architecture and detailed design for the Project Management System described in the Software Requirements Specification \(SRS\), version 1.0. It records the architectural pattern chosen for the system, the major components and how they interact, the security architecture, and the detailed design of representative workflows, the API surface and error handling. This document is the single reference used to guide implementation and to evaluate whether the delivered code matches the intended design. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
823 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 234 0 R
/T (1.2 Scope )
/E (1.2 Scope )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
824 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 234 0 R
/E (The scope of this document covers the backend \(Django REST Framework and Django Channels\), the frontend \(React single page application\), the data store \(PostgreSQL\) and the real-time channel layer \(Redis\), exactly as scoped in Section 2 of the SRS. It does not repeat the functional requirements themselves, which remain owned by the SRS; instead it explains how those requirements are realised architecturally. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
