/E (The diagram below shows the system decomposed into a React frontend, four backend domain modules running inside a single Django REST Framework service, a Django Channels WebSocket layer, PostgreSQL and Redis. The four backend modules correspond directly to the four feature groups in SRS Section 5 \(5.1-5.4\) and are owned by the same four team members who own those requirements. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [13]
>>
