/P 238 0 R
/E (The backend, frontend, PostgreSQL and Redis are each packaged as a separate Docker container and started together \(e.g. via docker-compose in development, and the same images behind Jenkins-built artifacts in CI\), matching the containerisation requirement in SRS Section 7. Django Channels workers can be scaled to more than one process behind Redis without any application code change, which is how the 50-concurrent- connection target in NFR-006 is met. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [6]
>>
