985 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 242 0 R
/E (The relational schema follows the ER diagram and field layout already published in SRS Section 4 and Appendix B. Two design additions sit on top of that schema: a soft-delete boolean on Workspace, Project and Task \(SRS Safety Requirements, Section 6.2\) so a delete is reversible until the final purge job runs, and a composite index on \(project_id, status\) for Task, since the Kanban board's primary query filters on exactly those two columns and must stay within the 2-second budget in NFR-001. )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
