>>
endobj
987 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 242 0 R
/E (Because PostgreSQL is always written before an event is published \(Section 3.1\), the WebSocket channel only ever announces state that has already been durably committed, avoiding a class of bugs where connected clients could see a status that a slower REST client would then fail to confirm. )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [23]
>>
