<<
/Title (The system is a web application accessed through a modern browser such as Chrome, Firefox or Edge, on desktop or laptop devices. The backend runs on Python 3 with Django REST Framework and Django Channels, deployed on a Linux based server or container. The database is PostgreSQL. The frontend is a React single page application. A Redis instance is used as the channel layer backing for WebSocket connections.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2201 0 R
>>
endobj
